@startuml
title Observer Lifecycle
[*] --> PENDING : container starts
PENDING --> ACTIVE : register (position from env / queued placement / default pattern)
ACTIVE --> ACTIVE : drift with water; exact time/position/depth published
ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : observation time ≥ 3 h
ACTIVE --> EVICTED : new observer beyond limit (oldest first)
EXPIRED --> ARCHIVED
EVICTED --> ARCHIVED
ARCHIVED : container exits (HTTP 410)
ARCHIVED : observation history retained in DB
ARCHIVED --> [*]
note right of ACTIVE
Detection state is per epoch:
slant range ≤ R_max → detected (no misses)
otherwise → non-detection (also information)
end note
@enduml
